Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(398,12)}The Day When I was Born
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(305.6,532.667)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.23,0:00:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lose my motivation if you are like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You always tell me to work hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.36,0:00:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so motivated...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.83,0:00:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But you repeat it, I have lost my motivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you act towards me like I'm your real son, Mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then will you study by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.83,0:00:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, you can study as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go out to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.21,0:00:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, you're so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.26,0:00:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember raising you to be like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.02,0:00:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My parents are so mean to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, you're the one at fault, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.98,0:00:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But she didn't had to abuse me like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.53,0:00:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:01:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, that must be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.41,0:01:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have been adopted by my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.08,0:01:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I was probably adopted!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say such things!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.21,0:01:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.55,0:01:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherefore art though, my real mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.89,0:01:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, let's see what really happened using Time Machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the day when you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.15,0:01:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Right Why didn't I get this idea, earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.99,0:01:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if I was adopted?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.24,0:01:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so suspicious. Hurry up and let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.53,0:01:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,To August 7, 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.18,0:02:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our home, 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no maps and paintings yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier in time, this used to be my dad's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.53,0:02:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks everyone's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.03,0:02:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How was I born if my parents are nowhere to be found?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.95,0:02:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, you must have been adopted probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.29,0:02:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding! Surely your parents must be in hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.63,0:02:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. So he's very young and handsome, 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who're you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you forget the face of your own child?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you're not born yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that, hurry and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my child?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:02:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's nowhere to be found!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:02:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not here neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.28,0:03:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I came back from work\Nafter I received the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You must go to hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.21,0:03:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.21,0:03:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But who are you two, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are wandering in my home from a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevermind! I must rush to hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.38,0:03:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father's anxious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, we will join you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.60,0:03:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, it's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.57,0:03:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, sorry... thanks...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.99,0:03:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.74,0:03:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how he looks...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.75,0:03:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm probably looking like the present me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be a very lively baby
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:03:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I become a father now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.46,0:04:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a big round face, just it's like his mother
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The baby's there, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.27,0:04:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lively!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us have a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.15,0:04:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my baby form?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He has wrinkles all over his face, and he looks like a monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with those children?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.62,0:04:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They're always following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what their parents have taught them
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.17,0:04:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Name your son!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've thought up of a decent name already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobi Nobita, don't you like the name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.43,0:04:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I should ask them directly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.89,0:04:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do that! You'll be scolded again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.18,0:04:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it's a good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:05:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A long branch of a tree Extending smoothly, growing to the higher heights...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he'll be a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he's an excellent kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be excellent in everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be good at sports if he's like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.25,0:05:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He summarised all your weak points...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very disappointed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.29,0:05:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he be a scholar or a politician...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.17,0:05:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd have been nice if he became an artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Or even a Painter, Sculptor or a Musician.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He has to be considerate...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Brave...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Be strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless, Confident, Honour, Handsome...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're overestimating your son's capability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.73,0:05:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not that special.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We must flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.49,0:05:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What did my son did to you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:05:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Who raised you two to be so stubborn!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know who your real parents are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My parents have put so much high hopes on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, you'll damage your health!\NPlease go to bed right this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.43,0:06:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you studying so hard so suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.27,0:06:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows how long this will last...
